{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1614.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"fe89be83ed1f90407fb3c83965af02700f5ac9129a6cf447ba6d0f532d7f7c34","ja":"おお～、それは見応えがありそうですな～。\nでは私は、駒さんぬぐるみをぎゅ～って、しますね～♪","zh":"哇～，那看起来会很有看头呢～。\n那我这就来紧～紧抱住驹子布偶咯～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1614.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"c66fca516756104f4077fcf98a2d1726422feeac258f63b0badba9f7d5700c65","ja":"あはっ、みんな自由にやってて楽しいの☆\nねえジュリア、次は『ぴえん』な表情やってみよ？","zh":"啊哈，大家都在自由发挥，好开心呀☆\n我说茱莉亚，接下来试着做一下“委屈巴巴”的表情吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1614.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"cfe144f25d049ba634a0fbf3134679199a4e076c2a468192fd88476291ea1cbb","ja":"はぁっ！？　なんだよそれ、難易度高くないか！？\n他の案はないのかよ……！？","zh":"哈啊！？那算什么啊，难度也太高了吧！？\n就没有其他方案了吗……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1614.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"de8ab040649ac4df51475f085604575caed76b21699dadfb1828de3fd18dc1ee","ja":"そうして、まとまりなく盛り上がった\nカオスな撮影から、数週間後……","zh":"就这样，在毫无条理却热闹非凡的\n混乱拍摄结束数周后……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1614.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"dda3c660e8f83b204d1fc12ef37048e60aafc60005d907e3d5e6a0168ebc162d","ja":"4人は集まって、公式のアカウントにアップされた、\n完成したMVを閲覧していて……","zh":"4人聚在一起，观看上传到官方账号的、\n制作完成的MV……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1614.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"12c0d4095a9ea2bf96806eb6154577a6d9a85d539dc4239cbfe6d68a719080f3","ja":"結局、最初のダンスが採用されたのね。\nセクシーポーズはお蔵入りかぁ……。","zh":"结果还是采用了最初的舞蹈呢。\n性感姿势被雪藏了吗……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1614.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"a9b6bdb9855272561d55ac95a4bcdecec1271e3a7bdbf00cc18ba3fdd37905ff","ja":"でも、MVはすっごく良かったって思うな！\nミキたちも、バッチリかわいく撮ってくれてたし♪","zh":"不过，我觉得MV拍得超级棒哦！\n把美希她们也拍得特别可爱♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1614.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"b820b43d844c735733d89b4cc839e58bd01bb3c1fb17b37b406957cd9459c463","ja":"そうだな。……って、あれ？\nなんか新しい投稿があるぞ。『MVおまけ集』……？","zh":"确实呢。……咦，等等？\n好像有新的投稿。《MV花絮集》……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1614.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"08f4c579ae097d571aadc80c3df0d4eddc23162902d3696aa39db49fc88a9cfb","ja":"どうやら、撮影中のオフショットをまとめてる\nみたいですね～。せっかくなので、見てみましょう～。","zh":"看起来好像是把拍摄花絮整理在一起了\n呢～。难得有这个机会，来看看吧～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1614.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"28be3281453529a177a98bf237196ef9e138b61054cb55672690dd9f83a2756c","ja":"ミキたちのかわいい姿、どんな感じに……あれ？\nなんだか、ジュリアばっかり目立ってるの～！？","zh":"美希她们可爱的身姿，究竟会变成……咦？\n怎么感觉，全都是茱莉亚在出风头啊～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1614.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"b3ff48ea31c936068a61d25b13ddeed16a78d1ff2fe898e3fe013279f40702e6","ja":"改めて見ると、他のパターンを考えてる時の\nジュリアちゃんって、撮れ高が良かったのね。","zh":"重新看一下才发现，在考虑其他方案的时候，\n茱莉亚拍出来的有效镜头还挺多的呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1614.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"37d1a336fe0d84dd798c7bb7bfc9bbf52b182c2d0829cca91aaa86ee2fc46284","ja":"上目遣いを練習しているところとか、\nみんなの提案にとまどってるところとか……。","zh":"练习向上看的样子啦，\n对大家的提议感到不知所措的样子啦……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1614.unity3d","item_key":"commands[53].text","source_sha256":"a5b62a0268f9d6d4025db228e2bdfeec408963bd3dd165c2a5f4258a1ee7d36a","ja":"むむむ……これは一本取られましたね～。\n私ももっと、ウケを狙うべきでしたか～。","zh":"唔唔唔……这下可真被将了一军呢～。\n我也应该多考虑一下怎么逗乐大家吗～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1614.unity3d","item_key":"commands[54].text","source_sha256":"06ccf3a6397580533a6fde5758b1479124f0b3f4077da13564425abd2c1b5e89","ja":"いや、別にあたしはそんなの意識してたわけじゃ……\nなんでこんなことになったんだ～！？","zh":"不，我倒不是特意在在意那种事……\n怎么会变成这样啊～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
